;    0: TWdLink(count=4428, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I'm running away. Without the courage to face my fate―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Daddy</STYLE> says there's no need to run away, and even the misfortune will be over soon.<PG>
But I'm running away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I haven't decided on any destination. I just want to get away, that's all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I also thought about holing up in the mountains for a while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that would be a waste of time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just using up time isn't like me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I only get one life; wasting time is out of the question.<PG>
In that case, I'd rather try going somewhere nobody knows me―somewhere with lots of people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a little sense of adventure helping things along, I'm swaying on a train.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where is this train headed?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I haven't even looked that up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't even feel like looking. Anywhere is fine.<PG>
I check the contents of my wallet once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In elementary school, I used to buy snacks now and then from the ice cream stand at <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="とよたけ">Toyotake</STYLE> Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I've held back from even that for about 2 years now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I need money.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"100,000 and... 394 yen, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is all the money I have.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I started middle school, I've barely spent any of my allowance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Touching my New Year's money is out of the question.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You can't weigh money against a person's life.<PG>
I've heard that where there are lots of people, there are lots of good people and lots of bad people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This wallet is my lifeline.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I keep it in my inside pocket, always on me, so I can feel it there at all times.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even this little-over-100,000 yen will probably be gone in a few days.<PG>
Once I'm out in a big town, I'll have to do my own hunting as much as I can, find water, and find somewhere I can sleep outdoors, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd be glad to find a place like that secret base, but a spot that good is rare even in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I can manage somewhere to sleep, food, I'll just have to get for myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A big town has lots of people, so there must be lots of animals to hunt for food, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
I'm heading for a big town in order to run away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not that I hated life in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, I didn't want to leave.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I don't have the courage to face it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because I can't face the urge to want to kill <STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE>, an urge I don't even want to imagine.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\東京.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\日々と泉.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\長城駅前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
After changing trains a few times, I arrived at a bustling station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This place is apparently called 'Sawa-<STYLE ID="5" RUBY="みなかみ">Minakami</STYLE> Station.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've heard that <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE> is the prefectural capital of <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="さわけん">Sawa Prefecture</STYLE>, a city with a population of about 400,000.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can probably manage here.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Whoa..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm overwhelmed by a cluster of buildings I've only ever seen on the school trip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. So this is what they call civilization.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Animals... 
{PAUSE ""}
there aren't any...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this many people around, the animals probably won't come near, so if I'm going to hunt, night would be better.<PG>
What I have with me right now is a few days' changes of clothes and toiletries―
{PAUSE ""}
and just two knives I'm used to using.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, I had no time to prepare.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to pick a time when no one would see me leave home, and on top of that, 'that' came suddenly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd actually meant to leave on August 1, my 15th birthday, but because 'that' came so suddenly, I had to move my plans up by nearly 4 months.<PG>
It was one or the other: 'that' first, or turning 15 first.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But honestly, I couldn't really picture that happening to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though I do feel it's late for my age.<PG>
Now, first I need to secure a base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll head toward the mountains as far as I can and look for a cave or a big tree that's perfect to live in, or else an empty house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even better if there's a stream nearby.<PG>
―And then, 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\パトカー走行.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
several police cars race past right in front of me, lined up one behind another.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Their roof lights are spinning, but they're not sounding their sirens, and their speed is normal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some kind of security detail?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll try following them a little.<PG>
I thought about running after them, but at school there was no one who could run as fast as me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A TV drama said that to live among lots of people, it's better to avoid standing out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I decide to follow them at a light jog, about the same as everyone else.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\長城駅前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I shift my bag on my shoulder and head off in the direction the police cars went.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This town has a lot of traffic lights.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every 500 meters or so, the police cars stop at a light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I can catch up to them right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this town, with so many people and so many cars, cars don't seem very useful.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I ran through Minakami City for about an hour, chasing the police cars.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Luckily I never lost sight of them, and it seems I made it to their destination.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\日の丸集団.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There, a crowd of thousands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone is holding Rising Sun flags and shouting toward something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And lots of people are taking pictures.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At my height, I can't see the front very well...<PG>
"His Majesty the Emperor, banzaaai!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Your Majesty the Empreeess!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Majesty the Emperor?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he's really here, this is the perfect chance to lay eyes on him!<PG>
I see, so the Sawa Prefectural Police and whoever else are out as his security detail.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The flag-waving gawkers cheer even louder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Majesty the Emperor and the Empress must be waving to everyone with gentle smiles.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It dawns on me, belatedly, that I may be in an outrageous place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I'm here anyway, I'll mingle with the gawkers a little longer.<PG>
Then, from beyond the crowd, a black car sets off and, flanked by police cars, heads away somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the gawkers scatter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems His Majesty the Emperor has left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seems I got here a little too late.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\庭園入口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Looking around again, I seem to be in front of grounds with large gardens.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looks like there's an admission fee, but beyond the gate I can glimpse vivid flowers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's already spring, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So His Majesty was here on a visit.<PG>
Thanks to chasing the police cars, I seem to have come out to the edge of town.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mountains are right there, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, I'll look for a place to sleep around here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, a man walks up.<PG>
"Hey, hey, what are you doing with that big bag?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He's about 50, maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His clothes are youthful for his face, he's neat, and at a glance he makes a good impression.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What am I doing, he asks...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... I was thinking I'd look for a place to sleep tonight."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? <STYLE ID="3">Miss</STYLE>, don't tell me you ran away from home?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well... I guess you could say that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then I'll show you a nice place!
{PAUSE ""}
　Come on, the car's over this way!"<PG>
{PLAYSND "日曜日の朝.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
At last I understand the situation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this is what they call a pickup.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In elementary school, I was a kid who told nothing but dirty jokes to <STYLE ID="8">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and my school friends, so my knowledge in that area was way beyond my age.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But around when I started middle school, <STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE> <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="しか">scolded</STYLE> me that it was about time I learned how to carry myself as a woman, and since then I've kept the crude talk sealed away.<PG>
At first glance, I'm a runaway girl fresh from the countryside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that sheltered girl is being picked up by some old guy I don't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This looks fun!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it looks like I'm in danger, I can just run, or beat him to a pulp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Judging from his build and the way he moves, he's clearly weaker than me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really!? I'm so glad I met a nice person!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　You'll show me a nice place... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">what kind of place is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Smiling, I play along with the old guy's offer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Why, a place with a proper bed and bath and everything!
{PAUSE ""}
　This old guy's somebody important, you know!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wow, amaaazing! I'll go, I'll go!"</STYLE><PG>
I have no intention whatsoever of relying on this old guy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's just curiosity, and if things look dangerous, I'll just run.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever my real purpose is, I came all the way to a big town, so it's no fun without an event like this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車室内エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\助手席から1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I get into the car he leads me to, leave the destination to the old guy, and relax in the passenger seat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As before, the car keeps getting caught at red lights, with none of the speed of the buggy back in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this rate, I'd be faster on foot...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, this car is fitted with some imposing machinery I've never seen before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's it used for?<PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Miss</STYLE>, what's your name?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ふるむら">My name's Akina </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="あきな">Furumura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just in case, I give a false name I came up with on the spot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Turning Kana Niimura into Akina Furumura was maybe a little too easy... [TN: nii/furu = new/old, ka/aki = summer/autumn]<PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Akina-chan</STYLE>, huh! What a cute name!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This old guy is blatantly a lolicon...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="あお">egg him on</STYLE> a little more.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hehe! I turn 15 this year! Finally, I round up to 20!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So you're 14 now, huh!
{PAUSE ""}
　I see, I see!
{PAUSE ""}
　Hmmm! I see, I see!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I desperately hold back from bursting out laughing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This blatant, I don't find him creepy―if anything, I almost find him cute.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Akina-chan</STYLE>, are you half-Japanese!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Your skin's so white and your face is so pretty, and your eyes are blue and green, too!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right! My dad's half Japanese, half American, and my mom's Russian!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, this is a huge lie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Despite how I look, I'm fully Japanese.<PG>
"Ho-hooo! I see, I see!
{PAUSE ""}
　Hmmm! I see, I see!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ehehe, do I have a cute face!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Anyone can see it! I thought you were a fairy!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, for a second, I burst out snorting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Me...! A fairy...!<PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Akina-chan</STYLE>, where are you from?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13" RUBY="いいざわ">Iizawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> Prefecture!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Iizawa Prefecture!? You came all the way from the next prefecture over, huh... 
{PAUSE ""}
Why Sawa Prefecture?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I figured, if I'm going anyway, I'd go somewhere nobody knows me!"</STYLE><PG>
"I see, I see! <STYLE ID="3">Akina Furumura-chan</STYLE>, 14, from Iizawa Prefecture, huh!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The old guy, going out of his way to repeat my personal information.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Akina-chan（provisional）</STYLE>, answering cheerfully.
{PAUSE ""}
